    "title": "Burlington County proposes $30M boardwalk along Rancocas Creek - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andrew Rowan ,\n5 hours ago Burlington County is proposing an estimated $30 million boardwalk along Rancocas Creek that would connect three county parks and provide pedestrians and cyclists with an alternative to traveling along Route 130. The proposed boardwalk would connect Pennington Park, Rainbow Meadow and Willingboro Lakes as part of the county's long-term effort... Read full article\n1",
